    "info": "Invokes a method on another Dapr app-id through this sidecar. Set the connection node's Dapr host/port and app port, and set the invoke node's target app-id to a real service before deploying. msg.dapr.statusCode and msg.dapr.headers carry the response metadata; msg.payload carries the decoded body."
